{
 "en": [
  {
   "text": "Your user interviews proved you right. Did they?",
   "start": 0.63,
   "end": 3.782,
   "rows": 2,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    105,
    200,
    974,
    356
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "You had a product hypothesis and you went looking for evidence in user research.",
   "start": 4.27,
   "end": 8.21,
   "rows": 3,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    69,
    200,
    1010,
    434
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "You found it, because you were looking for it in software feedback.",
   "start": 9.029,
   "end": 12.374,
   "rows": 3,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    127,
    200,
    953,
    434
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "It's not dishonesty. It's your brain protecting the first idea.",
   "start": 13.196,
   "end": 17.291,
   "rows": 2,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    65,
    200,
    1015,
    356
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Confirmation bias means we notice what fits our idea and ignore what doesn't.",
   "start": 17.77,
   "end": 21.889,
   "rows": 3,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    75,
    200,
    1005,
    434
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "In product user research, the question you ask shapes the answer you get.",
   "start": 22.708,
   "end": 26.624,
   "rows": 3,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    83,
    200,
    996,
    434
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "That's not curiosity; it's your judgment defending itself.",
   "start": 27.05,
   "end": 30.276,
   "rows": 2,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    94,
    200,
    986,
    356
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "You hear 'yes' because you asked in a way that invites yes.",
   "start": 31.095,
   "end": 34.476,
   "rows": 3,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    107,
    200,
    972,
    434
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "You ask 'Would you use this software feature?' and they say 'sure, maybe.'",
   "start": 34.95,
   "end": 39.164,
   "rows": 3,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    89,
    200,
    991,
    434
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "That's not evidence for product decisions. That's politeness.",
   "start": 39.983,
   "end": 43.947,
   "rows": 3,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    155,
    200,
    924,
    434
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "A leading question is a survey that agrees with you in advance.",
   "start": 44.769,
   "end": 47.852,
   "rows": 3,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    58,
    200,
    1022,
    434
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Try this: before any product interview, write what would prove you wrong.",
   "start": 48.36,
   "end": 52.336,
   "rows": 3,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    100,
    200,
    979,
    434
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Then ask questions that could give you that answer.",
   "start": 53.155,
   "end": 55.512,
   "rows": 2,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    66,
    200,
    1014,
    356
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Monitor whether you're asking to understand the user or only to agree with yourself.",
   "start": 55.99,
   "end": 60.121,
   "rows": 3,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    69,
    200,
    1011,
    434
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "If you can't be proven wrong, you're not doing research.",
   "start": 60.94,
   "end": 63.832,
   "rows": 2,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    71,
    200,
    1009,
    356
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "So: write what would prove you wrong before you start.",
   "start": 64.35,
   "end": 67.302,
   "rows": 2,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    100,
    200,
    979,
    356
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "If you can't be proven wrong, it's not research.",
   "start": 68.121,
   "end": 70.823,
   "rows": 2,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    71,
    200,
    1009,
    356
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "When did you last seek evidence that you were wrong in product research?",
   "start": 71.31,
   "end": 74.452,
   "rows": 3,
   "font": 54,
   "direction": "ltr",
   "bbox": [
    63,
    200,
    1016,
    434
   ]
  }
 ],
